{"seq":1,"slug":"velocity-throughput","title":"速率与吞吐量度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/execution/velocity-throughput","wordCount":1587,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"速率与吞吐量度量\">速率与吞吐量度量</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>速率（Velocity）度量基于故事点的承诺兑现能力，吞吐量（Throughput）度量基于条目计数的流动效率。Little 定律将 WIP、吞吐量和前置时间联系在一起。波动系数（CV）量化可预测性：CV &lt; 15% 高度稳定，&gt; 35% 需先诊断原因。度量不应被用作绩效指标或跨团队比较工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两种度量-两种视角\">两种度量，两种视角</h2><p>速率（Velocity）和吞吐量（Throughput）是度量团队交付能力的两种互补方法。它们回答不同的问题，适用于不同的决策场景，且各有统计特性上的优劣。理解它们的区别是建立可靠预测基线的前提。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>速率（Velocity）</th>\n<th>吞吐量（Throughput）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>度量单位</td>\n<td>故事点/Sprint</td>\n<td>完成条目数/时间单位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输入要求</td>\n<td>需要估算环节</td>\n<td>不需要估算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用流程</td>\n<td>Scrum（固定 Sprint）</td>\n<td>Kanban/任何流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>粒度假设</td>\n<td>条目大小不同</td>\n<td>条目大小趋近均匀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>统计稳定性</td>\n<td>中等（受校准漂移影响）</td>\n<td>高（纯计数更稳定）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用途</td>\n<td>Sprint 承诺、容量规划</td>\n<td>流动效率、发布预测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 速率视角&#10;    A[用户故事] --&gt;|&quot;估算&quot;| B[故事点]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Sprint 完成点数]&#10;    C --&gt; D[速率 = Σ点数/Sprint]&#10;    D --&gt; E[容量规划]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 吞吐量视角&#10;    F[工作条目] --&gt;|&quot;不估算&quot;| G[进入/离开系统]&#10;    G --&gt; H[完成条目计数]&#10;    H --&gt; I[吞吐量 = 条目数/时间]&#10;    I --&gt; J[流动效率分析]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    E --&gt; K[蒙特卡洛预测]&#10;    J --&gt; K\">graph TD\n    subgraph 速率视角\n    A[用户故事] --&gt;|\"估算\"| B[故事点]\n    B --&gt; C[Sprint 完成点数]\n    C --&gt; D[速率 = Σ点数/Sprint]\n    D --&gt; E[容量规划]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 吞吐量视角\n    F[工作条目] --&gt;|\"不估算\"| G[进入/离开系统]\n    G --&gt; H[完成条目计数]\n    H --&gt; I[吞吐量 = 条目数/时间]\n    I --&gt; J[流动效率分析]\n    end\n\n    E --&gt; K[蒙特卡洛预测]\n    J --&gt; K</pre><h2 id=\"速率的统计特性\">速率的统计特性</h2><p>速率是一个时间序列随机变量。要从中提取可靠的预测基线，需要理解其统计特性：</p>\n<p><strong>平稳性检验</strong>：速率数据必须满足平稳性（无趋势、无季节性）才能直接用于预测。常见的非平稳原因包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>团队成员增减（导致级别跳变）</li>\n<li>流程改进/退化（导致趋势）</li>\n<li>季节性因素（节假日、绩效周期）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>非平稳数据的处理：取差分、或只使用最近的平稳窗口。</p>\n<p><strong>自相关性</strong>：前一个 Sprint 的表现可能影响下一个 Sprint（如前一个 Sprint 赶工导致后一个 Sprint 需要休整）。如果自相关显著，简单的独立采样（蒙特卡洛中）会低估预测区间的宽度。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_k = \\frac{\\sum_{t=k+1}^{n}(v_t - \\bar{v})(v_{t-k} - \\bar{v})}{\\sum_{t=1}^{n}(v_t - \\bar{v})^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5463em;vertical-align:-0.994em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5523em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3057em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.748em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.994em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\rho_1| &gt; 0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span>，建议使用自回归模型或块采样（block bootstrapping）替代简单随机采样。</p>\n<p><strong>波动系数与可预测性分级</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CV 范围</th>\n<th>可预测性</th>\n<th>推荐策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&lt; 10%</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>Sprint 承诺可靠，简单除法即可预测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10-20%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>蒙特卡洛能给出窄区间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20-35%</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>蒙特卡洛必要，P50-P85 差距大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 35%</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>先诊断波动原因，预测宽到难以有用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"吞吐量与-little-定律\">吞吐量与 Little 定律</h2><p>吞吐量的理论基础是排队论中的 Little 定律：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda \\times W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> = 系统中的平均在制品数（WIP），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> = 吞吐量（单位时间完成的条目数），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> = 平均前置时间（Lead Time）。</p>\n<p>这个看似简单的公式有深刻的实践含义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>降低 WIP 可以缩短前置时间</strong>（在吞吐量不变时）</li>\n<li><strong>提高吞吐量可以缩短前置时间</strong>（在 WIP 不变时）</li>\n<li><strong>WIP 增加但吞吐量不变意味着前置时间增加</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[WIP = 10] --&gt; B[吞吐量 = 5/周]&#10;    B --&gt; C[前置时间 = 2 周]&#10;&#10;    D[WIP 降到 5] --&gt; E[吞吐量 ≈ 5/周]&#10;    E --&gt; F[前置时间 ≈ 1 周]&#10;&#10;    G[WIP 升到 20] --&gt; H[吞吐量 ≈ 5/周]&#10;    H --&gt; I[前置时间 ≈ 4 周]\">flowchart LR\n    A[WIP = 10] --&gt; B[吞吐量 = 5/周]\n    B --&gt; C[前置时间 = 2 周]\n\n    D[WIP 降到 5] --&gt; E[吞吐量 ≈ 5/周]\n    E --&gt; F[前置时间 ≈ 1 周]\n\n    G[WIP 升到 20] --&gt; H[吞吐量 ≈ 5/周]\n    H --&gt; I[前置时间 ≈ 4 周]</pre><h2 id=\"从度量到预测\">从度量到预测</h2><p>将速率/吞吐量数据转化为交付预测的两种路径：</p>\n<p><strong>路径一：确定性预测（简单但粗糙）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>剩余 Sprint 数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>剩余工作量</mtext><mtext>平均速率</mtext></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{剩余 Sprint 数} = \\frac{\\text{剩余工作量}}{\\text{平均速率}} = \\frac{R}{\\bar{v}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">剩余</span><span class=\"mord\"> Sprint </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">平均速率</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">剩余工作量</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>置信区间</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>±</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{置信区间} = \\frac{R}{\\bar{v} \\pm z \\cdot s/\\sqrt{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">置信区间</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3006em;vertical-align:-0.9403em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3097em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">±</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9403em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>适用条件：CV &lt; 15%、数据平稳、任务独立。</p>\n<p><strong>路径二：蒙特卡洛预测（精确但需要数据）</strong></p>\n<p>从历史吞吐量的经验分布中重复采样，模拟未来可能的路径。这种方法不假设分布形式，能自然处理偏态和厚尾。</p>\n<p>两种路径的选择依据：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>推荐方法</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据点 &lt; 8</td>\n<td>确定性 + 大缓冲</td>\n<td>数据不足以支撑概率模拟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CV &gt; 25%</td>\n<td>蒙特卡洛</td>\n<td>简单除法的置信区间无意义地宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>利益相关方需要概率</td>\n<td>蒙特卡洛</td>\n<td>P50/P85/P95 的表达更精确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快速粗算</td>\n<td>确定性</td>\n<td>Sprint 规划中的快速判断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"度量的陷阱与反模式\">度量的陷阱与反模式</h2><p><strong>陷阱一：Goodhart 定律</strong>\n&quot;当一个度量成为目标时，它就不再是一个好的度量。&quot;如果速率被用作绩效指标（&quot;这个 Sprint 我们要做到 40 点&quot;），团队会通货膨胀故事点来满足目标，使速率作为预测基线的价值完全丧失。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱二：跨团队比较</strong>\n速率是团队内部度量，不可跨团队比较。A 团队的&quot;1 点&quot;和 B 团队的&quot;1 点&quot;没有共同含义。用速率做绩效排名是对这个工具的滥用。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱三：忽略前置时间分布</strong>\n平均前置时间可能隐藏长尾。如果平均前置时间是 5 天但 P90 是 20 天，那&quot;我们通常 5 天完成&quot;是误导性陈述。关注百分位数而非均值。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱四：度量一切但不行动</strong>\n收集大量度量数据但不基于数据做决策。每个度量应当对应一个决策阈值——&quot;如果速率连续 3 个 Sprint 下降超过 20%，我们停下来诊断原因&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"建立可靠基线的操作清单\">建立可靠基线的操作清单</h2><ol>\n<li>收集最近 8-12 个 Sprint 的速率/吞吐量数据</li>\n<li>检查平稳性：是否存在趋势或级别跳变</li>\n<li>计算基本统计量：均值、中位数、标准差、CV</li>\n<li>检查异常值：是否有需要特殊处理的 Sprint</li>\n<li>确定采样策略：全部使用 / 只用最近 N 个 / 加权</li>\n<li>运行蒙特卡洛模拟并输出百分位数</li>\n<li>与实际结果持续对比校准</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>速率和吞吐量是互补的交付能力度量。速率考虑了条目间的大小差异但需要估算环节，吞吐量零开销但假设条目粒度均匀。Little 定律提供了从 WIP 控制前置时间的理论基础。建立可靠预测基线需要检查数据的平稳性、自相关性和异常值。最重要的是：每个度量应对应一个决策阈值——不行动的度量只是噪声。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"../methods/story-points-relative\">故事点与相对估算</a> 讨论了速率数据的产生过程和故事点校准问题；<a href=\"reestimation-triggers\">重新估算触发器</a> 定义了速率偏差到达什么阈值时应触发重新估算。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"速率与吞吐量度量","id":"速率与吞吐量度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"两种度量，两种视角","id":"两种度量-两种视角"},{"level":2,"text":"速率的统计特性","id":"速率的统计特性"},{"level":2,"text":"吞吐量与 Little 定律","id":"吞吐量与-little-定律"},{"level":2,"text":"从度量到预测","id":"从度量到预测"},{"level":2,"text":"度量的陷阱与反模式","id":"度量的陷阱与反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"建立可靠基线的操作清单","id":"建立可靠基线的操作清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"范围协商与约束管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/planning/scope-negotiation"},"next":{"title":"重新估算触发器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/execution/reestimation-triggers"}}